WEBVTT

00:26.010 --> 00:27.054
Whoa!

00:36.824 --> 00:39.663
A-Are you all right, Taiyo?

00:39.663 --> 00:41.040
Ugh.

00:43.295 --> 00:44.463
Sorry.

00:45.007 --> 00:45.967
I'm fine.

00:46.217 --> 00:49.600
Right. Taiyo,
swordsmanship's all about balance.

00:49.600 --> 00:52.731
Someinine's enhancements
tend to go to the eyes and hands,

00:52.731 --> 00:56.822
but it's more effective if you focus
on your core or all five of your senses.

00:57.281 --> 00:58.116
For example...

00:58.534 --> 00:59.661
something like this.

00:59.953 --> 01:00.830
Wait! Hey!

01:07.009 --> 01:07.969
So quick.

01:19.868 --> 01:22.957
You're still not used
to the Yozakura power, Taiyo,

01:22.957 --> 01:26.089
so it would be dangerous
to stay awakened for a long time.

01:26.381 --> 01:28.468
So stopping the enemy in their tracks

01:28.468 --> 01:31.015
should be the priority
over defeating them.

01:32.644 --> 01:33.771
Right.

01:34.105 --> 01:37.821
The power of our blood is just one aspect
of the Yozakuras' strength.

01:39.741 --> 01:41.285
Big Bro Kyoichiro.

01:41.995 --> 01:44.793
What will you be wielding that power for?

01:44.793 --> 01:47.799
That's what makes the Yozakuras so strong.

01:48.383 --> 01:49.511
Got that?

01:51.557 --> 01:54.103
All right, let's get back to training.

01:54.103 --> 01:55.021
Right.

01:55.021 --> 01:56.733
All right, for now...

01:56.733 --> 01:59.071
TRAINING MENU
why don't we cover
everything in this regimen?

01:59.573 --> 02:00.783
That many?

02:02.411 --> 02:04.541
Hey, where are you going, Big Bro?

02:05.041 --> 02:07.630
I've been tasked with a mission
by the Association.

02:08.131 --> 02:09.718
I'm heading overseas now.

02:09.718 --> 02:12.264
What? Is that right?

02:12.264 --> 02:15.061
I was hoping
you'd join me in training Taiyo.

02:16.272 --> 02:19.696
Your guidance is so spot-on,
I'd have nothing to contribute.

02:19.696 --> 02:22.201
Hey, thanks.

02:22.785 --> 02:24.330
Good luck on your mission.

02:25.207 --> 02:26.919
Taiyo!

02:28.421 --> 02:29.381
Mutsumi?

02:29.633 --> 02:31.595
Hey, Mutsumi!

02:31.595 --> 02:34.976
Did you miss your big bro that bad?

02:39.694 --> 02:44.078
Hey, Taiyo! I just took part
in the raffle at the Gaon Mall...

02:46.875 --> 02:49.338
and I won tickets
for a one-night, two-day trip

02:49.338 --> 02:51.552
to the Endless Hell Hot Springs!

02:52.595 --> 02:53.764
Huh?

02:54.683 --> 02:56.728
Endless Hell Hot Springs?

02:57.145 --> 03:00.778
YOZAKURA HOT SPRING STORY
Yes. It's a resort for members
of the underworld.

03:00.778 --> 03:03.742
It's invitation-only, and you
almost never win tickets to stay there!

03:03.742 --> 03:05.120
Wow.

03:11.465 --> 03:12.677
Mutsumi?

03:12.677 --> 03:14.263
There's nothing we can do.

03:14.263 --> 03:17.896
Tomorrow's the only day
that everyone's free.

03:17.896 --> 03:22.112
Sorry, but you have a mission, Big Bro,
so another time, okay?

03:23.072 --> 03:25.243
It's all right, Mutsumi!

03:25.243 --> 03:27.707
I'll just ditch this stupid mission!

03:30.337 --> 03:31.757
You know that's not happening.

03:32.382 --> 03:33.927
Such injustice!

03:33.927 --> 03:35.723
Why only me? Why?

03:35.723 --> 03:38.478
There's always someone who can't go,
and you know it.

03:42.486 --> 03:44.616
Don't start throwing a fit now.

03:46.202 --> 03:48.456
But it's a hot spring!

03:48.456 --> 03:50.544
It's my sworn mission to protect Mutsumi

03:50.544 --> 03:52.965
from unsavory characters
targeting her soft skin!

03:53.466 --> 03:55.428
You're the most unsavory of all.

03:59.854 --> 04:01.232
Sorry about this trip.

04:01.733 --> 04:03.654
Let's go together for sure
next time, okay?

04:04.656 --> 04:06.618
Mutsumi.

04:08.454 --> 04:11.127
Good luck with work, Big Bro.

04:13.882 --> 04:15.845
Your big bro's going to give it his all!

04:16.053 --> 04:17.807
I'll be going now!

04:18.182 --> 04:19.644
- Piece of cake.
- Piece of cake.

04:24.361 --> 04:27.827
Taiyo! Look, you, don't even think
about bathing with Mutsumi.

04:28.202 --> 04:29.079
Huh?

04:30.123 --> 04:33.004
I'll do more than just rip you to shreds.

04:35.091 --> 04:37.597
Okay, then, I'll be heading out, Mutsumi!

04:37.597 --> 04:39.684
Look forward to your souvenir, all right?

04:42.815 --> 04:44.151
<i>And so...</i>

04:45.445 --> 04:47.115
Hey, Shion...

04:47.533 --> 04:49.996
you sure this is the right road?

04:49.996 --> 04:52.125
Hmm. All good, all good.

04:52.125 --> 04:54.296
Since it's a shortcut
that I calculated myself.

04:54.631 --> 04:56.425
Yee-haw!

04:56.425 --> 04:58.096
This feels awesome!

04:58.597 --> 04:59.724
Hey, Kengo!

04:59.724 --> 05:01.520
Don't stick your head out!
It's dangerous!

05:04.066 --> 05:05.485
Are you okay, Nanao?

05:05.986 --> 05:07.949
I'm going to throw up.

05:10.411 --> 05:14.169
All the organic capsules
that I'm synthesizing in my body...

05:14.169 --> 05:15.631
Like a sea turtle laying eggs!

05:16.842 --> 05:18.720
Hey, Shion...

05:18.720 --> 05:21.308
Didn't you hear me tell you
that it's all good?

05:21.308 --> 05:23.312
But up ahead...

05:23.814 --> 05:26.485
it's a lake!

05:33.667 --> 05:35.963
Uh, um... aren't we about to sink?

05:36.255 --> 05:37.925
No problem.

05:43.854 --> 05:44.939
Whoa!

05:44.939 --> 05:46.526
So cool!

05:47.945 --> 05:50.366
It's a place
where people from the underworld

05:50.366 --> 05:52.788
can let loose to their hearts' content.

05:52.788 --> 05:55.001
So you can't get there by normal means.

06:10.073 --> 06:11.993
Hey, are we here?

06:11.993 --> 06:12.828
Yes.

06:13.245 --> 06:16.544
So why don't we kick back
for the first time in ages?

06:19.299 --> 06:21.220
Welcome! We are pleased to have you.

06:21.220 --> 06:23.767
SOUVENIRS

06:26.940 --> 06:29.403
DEATH

06:31.073 --> 06:32.075
Don't worry.

06:32.868 --> 06:36.417
It's taboo to fight or kill each other
on the premises, all right?

06:36.417 --> 06:37.670
She's right.

06:37.670 --> 06:40.174
It's the same as any other inn, Taiyo.

06:41.093 --> 06:43.724
Wow! Unbelievable!

06:43.724 --> 06:45.811
These aren't wooden swords!
They're real swords!

06:47.105 --> 06:48.274
N-Normal?

06:48.775 --> 06:49.819
Yes, that's right.

06:50.069 --> 06:51.823
Huh?

06:52.950 --> 06:55.914
Wh-Wh-What are
the Yozakuras doing here?

06:56.415 --> 06:57.250
Who's that?

06:57.250 --> 06:58.210
Beats me.

07:00.381 --> 07:02.511
Hey, I remember now.

07:02.511 --> 07:05.559
They're the people from the bad group
that Big Bro demolished.

07:05.559 --> 07:07.980
You're right.
They do look familiar.

07:07.980 --> 07:09.609
How have you all been?

07:09.609 --> 07:11.320
ENDLESS HELL HALL

07:41.840 --> 07:42.758
That's enough.

07:44.177 --> 07:47.977
If you make a commotion,
it will disturb the other guests.

07:48.227 --> 07:49.229
Not only that...

07:50.941 --> 07:54.907
HOSTESS
but have you forgotten
the rules here, sir?

07:57.370 --> 08:00.586
Soaking in our inn's hot springs
and savoring the finest meals

08:00.586 --> 08:04.342
will heal all of your rage and hatred.

08:05.011 --> 08:06.388
Huh. Come on.

08:07.641 --> 08:09.812
Long time no see, Madam.

08:09.812 --> 08:10.647
Huh?

08:10.647 --> 08:13.319
Yes, it's been a long time.

08:13.319 --> 08:16.074
Well, now, where's Mr. Kyoichiro?

08:16.074 --> 08:17.870
Unfortunately, he had to work.

08:17.870 --> 08:19.247
What a shame.

08:19.372 --> 08:21.711
To make up for it,
we brought our new groom.

08:22.003 --> 08:23.590
This is Mutsumi's husband...

08:24.675 --> 08:25.677
...Taiyo.

08:25.928 --> 08:27.263
Oh, my!

08:28.390 --> 08:29.644
Nice to meet you.

08:30.520 --> 08:34.152
I am the lady of the house here, Emma.

08:34.152 --> 08:37.826
I thank you for making time
in your busy schedule to visit us today.

08:39.120 --> 08:41.584
I've put you in separate rooms, by gender.

08:41.584 --> 08:43.087
Please enjoy a relaxing stay here.

08:45.091 --> 08:46.218
- Huh?
- Come on.

08:46.218 --> 08:48.305
You're both so childish.

08:48.640 --> 08:49.725
Mine!

08:49.725 --> 08:51.270
Got it!

08:51.771 --> 08:52.690
What are you doing?

08:53.190 --> 08:56.864
Fighting over the chairs by the window
is a Yozakura tradition.

08:56.864 --> 08:58.158
O-Oh.

08:59.452 --> 09:00.329
Huh?

09:00.329 --> 09:04.964
Is it okay if I sit here, Big Bro Shinzo?

09:10.141 --> 09:12.730
Pl-Please... for as long as you like.

09:13.857 --> 09:14.900
Thanks!

09:15.902 --> 09:18.240
Big Bro, you're such a bottom feeder!

09:18.240 --> 09:20.119
Huh? What's up, Taiyo?

09:20.453 --> 09:22.583
Oh, uh... actually...

09:22.833 --> 09:25.881
this reminds me of when I used to go
on trips with my family.

09:25.881 --> 09:29.054
Come to think of it, my kid brother
liked sitting by the window, too.

09:34.774 --> 09:35.901
Sit down.

09:35.901 --> 09:36.944
Yes, yes.

09:37.445 --> 09:40.409
Stretch out your legs, too, Big Bro Taiyo.

09:41.495 --> 09:43.457
N-No, I'm fine!

09:44.250 --> 09:48.885
All right, next, do you want to watch
something ultra-steamy on the pay channel?

09:48.885 --> 09:51.056
Hey, Kengo! You can't do that.

09:51.056 --> 09:53.728
Why are you always trying to watch that
whenever we come here?

09:54.104 --> 09:54.939
Huh?

09:55.649 --> 09:57.110
Because it's my duty as a man.

09:57.611 --> 09:59.322
Looking cool while you say it
isn't gonna work!

09:59.573 --> 10:00.701
Bottom line, you can't!

10:01.201 --> 10:02.036
Bad boy!

10:02.036 --> 10:03.455
What are you, my mom?

10:04.290 --> 10:05.376
VOLUNTARY RESTRICTIONS

10:05.376 --> 10:06.378
Seriously...

10:06.713 --> 10:08.842
what's so entertaining about this?

10:10.010 --> 10:11.597
What are you doing watching it, too?

10:12.014 --> 10:14.018
Huh? For my education?

10:15.605 --> 10:16.858
Hey! Come on.

10:16.858 --> 10:18.485
Wow.

10:21.659 --> 10:22.745
So beautiful.

10:25.834 --> 10:26.627
Mutsumi?

10:27.003 --> 10:29.257
What is it, Big Sis?

10:29.633 --> 10:32.639
Are you going to tell Taiyo... about that?

10:35.102 --> 10:38.358
Oh, wow. So you were onto me after all?

10:39.110 --> 10:41.448
No, just a gut feeling.

10:46.500 --> 10:50.007
You know, sometimes it's easier to
blurt it out when you're away from home.

10:51.761 --> 10:52.596
Right.

10:53.556 --> 10:55.351
There's nothing to worry about.

10:55.351 --> 10:57.523
Taiyo's sure to accept it.

10:59.192 --> 11:00.027
Thanks...

11:00.695 --> 11:01.864
...Big Sis Futaba.

11:04.995 --> 11:07.709
SCORCHING HOT HELL
SPECIALTY SAUNA UP TO 300 DEGREES

11:11.424 --> 11:13.680
I-I'm going to melt.

11:14.347 --> 11:19.315
The winner gets fruit-flavored milk.
The winner gets fruit-flavored milk.

11:19.315 --> 11:21.152
It's been ten minutes.

11:21.152 --> 11:23.198
The current temperature is 200 degrees.

11:23.198 --> 11:24.910
I'm not done by a long shot.

11:24.910 --> 11:27.248
Are you okay, Nanao?

11:27.498 --> 11:30.087
I-I'm going to die.

11:30.797 --> 11:32.843
Oh, hey, I know!

11:33.260 --> 11:36.851
This body's more heat-tolerant!

11:36.851 --> 11:38.061
- That's cheating!
- That's cheating!

11:42.571 --> 11:44.157
So yummy!

11:45.492 --> 11:47.873
I've still got a lot of training to do.

11:55.680 --> 11:57.475
Big Sis, you're amazing!

11:57.475 --> 11:58.895
Yeah, huh?

11:59.395 --> 12:00.857
What?

12:01.942 --> 12:04.155
Well, I guess that should do it.

12:04.155 --> 12:05.825
Uh, actually...

12:06.117 --> 12:08.330
isn't this going too far?

12:33.881 --> 12:36.595
BANQUET HALL

12:37.096 --> 12:39.977
Wow! Looks delicious!

12:43.651 --> 12:47.576
Mmm. This fried chicken is the bomb!

12:47.576 --> 12:50.874
Shion, don't steal my fried chicken.

12:50.874 --> 12:53.336
And don't casually
leave veggies in its place.

12:55.299 --> 12:58.806
My, my, you have such a healthy appetite
for someone so small!

12:59.057 --> 13:01.562
Yeah, this is so delicious.

13:01.562 --> 13:03.273
I can't wait for dessert!

13:04.275 --> 13:06.362
Mutsumi! You're so sweet!

13:06.781 --> 13:08.826
My Mutsumi!

13:08.826 --> 13:10.078
You sound just like that jerk...

13:10.078 --> 13:11.372
What's wrong, Taiyo?

13:11.372 --> 13:13.085
You're not hungry?

13:13.085 --> 13:14.505
N-No.

13:14.713 --> 13:17.552
Those guys are beyond raucous.

13:17.552 --> 13:20.224
Would it kill them
to be quiet at least during dinner?

13:20.517 --> 13:22.729
Y-You're right about that.

13:22.729 --> 13:24.106
Hey, Yozakura!

13:25.025 --> 13:28.908
You've got some nerve
breaking up our organization.

13:29.408 --> 13:30.954
Thanks to you--

13:30.954 --> 13:32.666
Thanks to you, I...

13:33.416 --> 13:35.295
What a girly-man you are,

13:35.295 --> 13:37.884
not knowing when to let go of the past.

13:37.884 --> 13:39.805
What did you say?

13:39.805 --> 13:41.517
Boss, you can't do that.

13:41.517 --> 13:44.063
He's right. Fighting is taboo here.

13:44.063 --> 13:44.940
Shut up!

13:44.940 --> 13:46.694
- You've had too much to drink--
- Let me go!

13:46.694 --> 13:47.946
- Let me go!
- Hey, hey...

13:50.158 --> 13:50.994
- Huh?
- Huh?

13:53.916 --> 13:55.210
Eat that, suckers!

13:55.503 --> 13:58.133
- That moron!
- Wh-What did you do?

14:12.244 --> 14:14.958
This alcohol sure is tasty!

14:15.208 --> 14:17.631
Big Sis Futaba can't hold her liquor!

14:17.631 --> 14:19.927
On top of that, she can't stop laughing!

14:21.095 --> 14:24.393
Watch out! When Bis Sis is drunk,
she doesn't hold back!

14:24.393 --> 14:25.521
What?

14:28.234 --> 14:31.575
Hey, Taiyo! We'll take care of Big Sis.

14:31.575 --> 14:33.453
You take Mutsumi somewhere safe!

14:33.621 --> 14:35.165
R-Roger that!

14:39.967 --> 14:43.390
We're here on vacation,
but I'm totally wiped.

14:44.518 --> 14:46.522
Thanks, Taiyo.

14:47.524 --> 14:48.358
Sure.

14:49.778 --> 14:51.740
Huh? What's that sound?

14:51.865 --> 14:54.705
Oh, that? It's the open-air bath.

14:54.997 --> 14:56.290
Open-air bath?

14:56.290 --> 14:59.463
Yes. This room
has its own private open-air bath.

14:59.463 --> 15:01.300
Really? Sounds good.

15:02.094 --> 15:03.973
Well, I did work up a sweat,

15:03.973 --> 15:06.729
so I think I'll head back to my room
and have another soak.

15:06.729 --> 15:08.023
If you need me, let me know.

15:13.491 --> 15:14.911
Listen, Taiyo...

15:16.164 --> 15:18.586
why don't we take a bath together?

15:19.880 --> 15:21.049
Huh?

15:22.468 --> 15:25.767
I was told that you were on a mission
and wouldn't be able to make it this time,

15:26.017 --> 15:27.729
so I'm glad to see you.

15:28.522 --> 15:30.358
Compared to protecting
Mutsumi on vacation,

15:30.358 --> 15:31.904
that mission was a walk in the park.

15:31.904 --> 15:33.949
You haven't changed, have you?

15:35.285 --> 15:39.376
Now, then, everyone's having dinner
in the Great Hall now.

15:43.134 --> 15:43.969
Huh?

15:44.428 --> 15:46.099
What's wrong, Big Bro?

15:46.099 --> 15:47.852
Th-That's--

15:47.852 --> 15:48.687
Huh?

15:49.146 --> 15:50.775
Whoa!

16:11.775 --> 16:14.321
Hey, it's pretty hot, isn't it?

16:14.321 --> 16:15.741
Y-Yeah.

16:15.908 --> 16:18.664
Ahh! Talk about heavenly!

16:19.624 --> 16:21.252
Hmm? What's wrong, Taiyo?

16:21.753 --> 16:24.341
U-Uh, hey, it's nothing.

16:24.341 --> 16:26.262
Come on! We're married, you know.

16:26.262 --> 16:28.099
It's just a bath.
How normal could that be?

16:28.099 --> 16:31.230
Besides, the water's milky-white,
so there's no reason to be embarrassed!

16:31.230 --> 16:32.859
You sure are matter-of-fact about it.

16:33.026 --> 16:36.449
Yes. I used to soak with my brothers
when we were little.

16:36.658 --> 16:39.581
Uh... it's not quite the same thing.

16:40.583 --> 16:41.417
Huh?

16:42.419 --> 16:44.256
Big Sis is still rampaging.

16:46.595 --> 16:48.724
But I kind of like this, you know.

16:48.724 --> 16:49.559
What?

16:49.559 --> 16:52.982
Everyone making a commotion for no reason
or else taking it easy.

16:54.318 --> 16:56.364
That's what being a family's
all about, right?

16:59.286 --> 17:02.502
Listen, Taiyo, there's something
that I want to talk to you about.

17:02.502 --> 17:03.336
Huh?

17:08.764 --> 17:09.975
M-Mutsumi?

17:09.975 --> 17:12.145
Hey! What are you doing?

17:18.659 --> 17:21.707
H-How'd you get that scar?

17:22.040 --> 17:23.794
When I was in sixth grade,

17:23.794 --> 17:28.344
I was abducted by Tanpopo,
and they nearly removed my heart.

17:28.762 --> 17:33.313
The Yozakura head's heart
is more or less a chunk of someinine,

17:33.313 --> 17:36.277
and it's head and shoulders above blood
in terms of concentration.

17:36.778 --> 17:39.743
It can produce tens of thousands
of compatibles at once.

17:40.243 --> 17:44.627
But that would also produce
tens of thousands of victims.

17:45.630 --> 17:48.761
It's no coincidence
that your blood was also compatible.

17:48.761 --> 17:49.596
What?

17:50.013 --> 17:53.687
That day, your body
had weakened to its utmost limit.

17:54.188 --> 17:58.446
That's the optimum time to balance out
the potency of the Yozakura blood.

17:58.446 --> 17:59.908
I read that in the family records.

18:00.743 --> 18:05.377
I knew that your body would acclimate
to it without any major side effects,

18:05.377 --> 18:07.965
and most of all, being out of options,

18:07.965 --> 18:13.101
at that moment, I was convinced
that it was the best way to save you.

18:14.061 --> 18:17.860
But it was all set up
to happen that way...

18:18.361 --> 18:19.321
by my father.

18:19.906 --> 18:21.660
F-Father?

18:22.662 --> 18:23.789
Your father?

18:24.749 --> 18:26.628
But I thought that he'd passed away?

18:26.878 --> 18:28.632
That's what I thought, too.

18:29.133 --> 18:32.347
But when the mansion
was under attack by Tanpopo,

18:32.347 --> 18:35.855
Big Bro Kyoichiro says
that he met with Father in the woods.

18:36.313 --> 18:38.151
I couldn't believe it at first,

18:38.151 --> 18:40.573
but it does explain
the blackout at the mansion

18:40.573 --> 18:42.702
and how Hibernation got activated.

18:43.035 --> 18:44.371
Why would he do that?

18:44.873 --> 18:47.962
My father dragged all of us,
along with Tanpopo,

18:47.962 --> 18:52.638
into his plot to make sure
that you were infused with Yozakura blood.

18:52.638 --> 18:55.351
But why? Why do that
to someone he's never even met?

18:56.103 --> 18:57.481
I don't know.

18:57.648 --> 19:00.738
Right. I don't know anything at all.

19:02.449 --> 19:03.326
<i>Mutsumi...</i>

19:04.244 --> 19:05.205
<i>forgive me.</i>

19:06.415 --> 19:08.754
<i>I'll save your mother.</i>

19:08.921 --> 19:11.718
<i>You go on ahead
and escape with Kyoichiro.</i>

19:12.135 --> 19:14.181
<i>Father...</i>

19:14.807 --> 19:17.395
I don't know why
he did such a thing to you

19:17.395 --> 19:20.653
or why he never once came to see us,
even though he was alive all this time.

19:21.487 --> 19:24.117
When you agreed to marry me,

19:24.117 --> 19:27.499
I thought I was ready
to take on anything, come what may.

19:28.251 --> 19:32.677
But the reality turned out to be
way beyond anything I'd imagined.

19:33.302 --> 19:35.390
I've totally lost sight, you see,

19:35.390 --> 19:41.570
of what it is that I should do for you...
for the family... for myself.

19:44.534 --> 19:46.830
Let's go see your father.

19:49.251 --> 19:51.463
Why did he go and do something like that?

19:51.463 --> 19:53.134
Why didn't he ever come to see you?

19:53.927 --> 19:57.058
Sure, a happy reunion's
probably not in the cards,

19:57.058 --> 20:00.273
but I bet something good
will come out of it.

20:00.273 --> 20:01.150
And besides...

20:01.735 --> 20:04.323
I still haven't introduced myself to him
as his son-in-law.

20:08.122 --> 20:09.374
Taiyo.

20:16.681 --> 20:17.934
Big Bro Shinzo!

20:18.434 --> 20:21.315
B-Both of you... run.

20:22.275 --> 20:25.406
I thought I'd warned you, Taiyo Asano.

20:26.116 --> 20:28.997
"Don't even think about bathing together."

20:29.247 --> 20:31.753
B-Big Bro Kyoichiro?

20:31.753 --> 20:33.882
Big Bro, what are you doing here?

20:33.882 --> 20:34.967
What about your mission?

20:35.803 --> 20:38.432
Everything's a breeze
if it's for your sake, Mutsumi.

20:38.432 --> 20:41.021
No, wait, how'd you get here
from the other side of the world--

20:41.021 --> 20:42.608
All right, Taiyo.

20:42.608 --> 20:45.071
Why don't I
fill that tub up with your blood?

20:46.115 --> 20:48.369
No!

20:50.749 --> 20:52.168
Big Sis Futaba?

20:53.337 --> 20:55.466
I'm finally sobering up now.

20:55.466 --> 20:57.262
Make a run for it, you two!

20:57.847 --> 20:59.517
Stay out of my way, drunkard!

21:00.018 --> 21:03.232
Right back at you!
Back off already, you jet-lagged sis-con!

21:03.734 --> 21:05.445
Huh! Fine by me.

21:05.445 --> 21:08.034
Since fighting here is taboo,

21:08.034 --> 21:10.455
how about a fun pillow fight,
just like the old days?

21:11.708 --> 21:12.918
You guys...

21:13.294 --> 21:14.379
now's your chance!

21:16.091 --> 21:19.055
You rotten first son,
how dare you do that to our chief!

21:26.738 --> 21:28.491
Whoa!

21:33.710 --> 21:34.545
Take that!

21:45.191 --> 21:47.320
No!

21:50.661 --> 21:53.249
Big Bro!

21:53.249 --> 21:56.255
Aww!

21:58.300 --> 21:59.135
Now, guys!

22:03.937 --> 22:05.106
Here we go!

22:16.211 --> 22:17.005
D...

22:18.090 --> 22:19.844
D-Damn it.

22:22.015 --> 22:24.562
Victory is ours!

22:24.562 --> 22:25.689
- Yeah!
- Yeah!

22:25.689 --> 22:26.524
We're amazing!

22:27.776 --> 22:31.325
<i>And so, this pillow fight
involving the entire resort</i>

22:31.325 --> 22:35.458
<i>would go down as a legendary battle,
passed down and recounted for generations.</i>

24:06.348 --> 24:10.982
NEXT TIME
A DRUG CALLED TANPOPO
